{"id":"n64525-1-7","stage":2,"title":"넘어서다 · 翻越","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64525-1-7-1","ko":"큰길까지 얼마나 더 가야 돼요?","zh":"还要走多远才能到大路呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"큰길까지","meaning":"大道","explanation":"큰길：大道；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"큰길","audio":"/audio/319688b45ab65c19f38d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72173","senseId":"1","lemma":"큰길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰길까지","audio":"/audio/84fcebb5a4f57c458303.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少。","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"가야","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가야","audio":"/audio/6aca1779d1b3c7fc08b4.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요?","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"319688b45ab65c19","term":"큰길","zh":"大道","audio":"/audio/319688b45ab65c19f38d.mp3","entryId":"72173","definition":"宽阔的道路。","pronunciation":["큰길"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":